### Mechanic: Dynamic Environment Modulation
INTENT: Each frame reads static modifiers to randomize puck friction, shift the bell height, and decay mallet power without streaks or scoring.
PSEUDO:
  local heat = AttractionConstants.modifiers.heat
  local luck = AttractionConstants.modifiers.luck
  local sleight = AttractionConstants.modifiers.sleight
  puck_friction = 0.5 + (heat * 0.2) + (luck * -0.1) + (sleight * -0.1)
  SetFriction(puck, puck_friction)
  bell_offset = bell_offset + (luck * 0.05)
  MoveKinematic(bell_body, GetPosition(bell_body).x, GetPosition(bell_body).y + bell_offset, GetPosition(bell_body).z, 0)
  mallet_health = mallet_health * (1 - (heat * 0.01))
API:
  SetFriction(handle, v)
  MoveKinematic(handle, lx, ly, lz, dt)
